      "reach": "Send a prompt to a slow model, then type another and press Enter.",
      "proof": "The queued row shows the text and the chat does not; Arrow Up puts it back in the composer; send on the row and Cmd/Ctrl+Enter put it in the chat.",
      "scenarios": [
        {
          "id": "send-now",
          "kind": "path",
